{"id": "17-3155-2-2", "zh": "kī 等动词类（kiyādigaṇa）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3156-2-12", "zh": "kī（词根）表示交换财物；加前缀 vi，（辅音）重复，语尾的产生与前面相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3157-2-7", "zh": "513. 在 kī 等之后加 nā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3158-2-10", "zh": "在以 kī 为首的这一类词根之后，于主动语态中加 nā 词缀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3158-11-35", "zh": "因为后面接 nā，所以不作强化（vuddhi）；依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，kī 等在 nā 之前变为短音；并且 kī 之后 nā 词缀的 n 音变为 ṇ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3159-2-6", "zh": "bhaṇḍaṃ vikkiṇāti（他卖货物）、vikkiṇanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3159-7-10", "zh": "vikkīyati、vikkīyanti（被卖）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3159-11-14", "zh": "vikkiṇātu、vikkiṇantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3159-15-18", "zh": "vikkīyatu、vikkīyantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3159-19-23", "zh": "vikkiṇe、vikkiṇeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3159-24-27", "zh": "vikkīyeyya、vikkīyeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3159-28-31", "zh": "avikkiṇi、vikkiṇi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3159-32-35", "zh": "vikkīyittha、vikkīyi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3159-36-39", "zh": "vikkiṇissati、vikkiṇissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3159-40-43", "zh": "vikkīyissati、vikkīyissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3159-44-47", "zh": "avikkiṇissa、avikkiṇissaṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3159-48-52", "zh": "vikkīyissa、vikkīyissaṃsu 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-2-9", "zh": "ji（词根）表示胜利：kilese jināti（战胜烦恼）、jinanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3160-10-13", "zh": "jīyati、jīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-14-16", "zh": "同样：jinātu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3160-17-18", "zh": "jīyatu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-19-20", "zh": "jineyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-21-22", "zh": "jīyeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-23-30", "zh": "ajini、jini、ajiniṃsu、jiniṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-31-34", "zh": "ajesi、ajesuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-35-36", "zh": "ajinittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-37-40", "zh": "ajīyittha、ajīyi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-41-44", "zh": "jinissati、jinissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-45-48", "zh": "vijessati、vijessanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-49-52", "zh": "jīyissati、jīyissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-53-54", "zh": "ajinissa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3160-55-57", "zh": "ajīyissa 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3161-2-10", "zh": "同样，ci（词根）表示积集：cināti、cinanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3162-2-5", "zh": "ñā（词根）表示了知，加 nā 词缀。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3163-2-9", "zh": "“vā”（或）一词延续下来。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3164-2-9", "zh": "514. ñā 变为 jā、jaṃ、nā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3165-2-11", "zh": "ñā 这个词根可以替换为 jā、jaṃ、nā 这几个替代形。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3166-2-10", "zh": "这里，在 nā 之前替换为 jā，在 ñā 之前替换为 jaṃ，在 ti 之前变成 nā；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3167-2-3", "zh": "这是因为延续下来的 vā 一词表示有定选择（vavatthitavibhāsā）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3168-2-9", "zh": "dhammaṃ vijānāti（了知法），或作 vināyati；vijānanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3169-2-6", "zh": "被动语态：viññāyati、viññāyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3169-7-24", "zh": "增加 i 音时删去前面的元音，依“kvaci dhātu”等规则变为 e，并且（y）重复：ñeyyati、ñeyyanti。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3169-25-30", "zh": "vijānātu、vijānantu；变为短音：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3169-31-36", "zh": "vijāna、vijānāhi、vijānātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3169-37-40", "zh": "vijānāmi、vijānāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3169-41-44", "zh": "vijānataṃ、vijānantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3169-45-46", "zh": "vijānassu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3169-47-50", "zh": "viññāyatu、viññāyantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3170-2-11", "zh": "515. 在 ñā 之后，eyya 可以变为 iyā、ñā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3171-2-17", "zh": "在 ñā 这个词根之后的语尾 eyya，可以替换为 iyā、ñā 这两个替代形，并作删元音等变化。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3171-18-19", "zh": "vijāniyā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3172-2-8", "zh": "替换为 ñā 时，（词根）ñā 替换为 jaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3173-2-12", "zh": "“ñāto”与“vā”两词也延续下来。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3174-2-8", "zh": "516. nā 删去，或变为 y 音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3175-2-18", "zh": "在 ñā 这个词根之后的 nā 词缀可以删去，也可以变为 y 音；这里的 vā 一词表示有定选择。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3175-19-20", "zh": "因此——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3176-2-5", "zh": "在 ñā 之前，nā 一定删去，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3177-2-3", "zh": "在不定过去时（ajjatanī）等之中则可删可不删；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3178-2-6", "zh": "在其他地方就不删去；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3179-2-5", "zh": "在 ti 之前，nā 变为 y 音。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-3180-2-10", "zh": "鼻音 ṃ 变为同组的鼻音：vijaññā、vijāneyya、vijāneyyuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3180-11-14", "zh": "vijāneyyāsi、vijāneyyātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3180-15-21", "zh": "vijāneyyāmi、vijāneyyāma，或作 vijānemu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3180-22-23", "zh": "vijānetha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3180-24-27", "zh": "viññāyeyya、viññāyeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3181-2-7", "zh": "samajāni、sañjāni、sañjāniṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3181-8-13", "zh": "删去 nā 时：aññāsi、aññāsuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3181-14-15", "zh": "vijānittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3181-16-17", "zh": "viññāyittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3181-18-21", "zh": "paññāyi、paññāyiṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3181-22-25", "zh": "vijānissati、vijānissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3181-26-29", "zh": "ñassati、ñassanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3181-30-33", "zh": "viññāyissate、viññāyissante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3181-34-37", "zh": "paññāyissati、paññāyissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3181-38-54", "zh": "依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，ssa 变为 hi：paññāyihiti、paññāyihinti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3181-55-56", "zh": "ajānissa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3181-57-58", "zh": "ajānissatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3181-59-63", "zh": "aññāyissatha、aññāyissa 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3182-2-20", "zh": "mā（词根）表示量度；依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，mā 的末尾变为 i：mināti、minanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3182-21-26", "zh": "被动语态：mīyati、mīyanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
